ion shines during implementation: validate a signup form against real risk data, generate fixtures from live lookups, or ask the agent to wire a screening step into onboarding. Tools run in context, so Cursor sees your code and the response together."},"208":{"id":"/docs/ui/agents/cursor-11","page_id":"/docs/ui/agents/cursor","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/agents/cursor#setup","content":"Go to Cursor Settings → Features → MCP Servers."},"209":{"id":"/docs/ui/agents/cursor-12","page_id":"/docs/ui/agents/cursor","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/agents/cursor#setup","content":"Click Add New MCP Server and enter:"},"210":{"id":"/docs/ui/agents/cursor-13","page_id":"/docs/ui/agents/cursor","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/agents/cursor#setup","content":"Name: ambriel"},"211":{"id":"/docs/ui/agents/cursor-14","page_id":"/docs/ui/agents/cursor","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/agents/cursor#setup","content":"Type: url"},"212":{"id":"/docs/ui/agents/cursor-15","page_id":"/docs/ui/agents/cursor","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/agents/cursor#setup","content":"URL: https://mcp.ambriel.io/compliance"},"213":{"id":"/docs/ui/agents/cursor-16","page_id":"/docs/ui/agents/cursor","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/agents/cursor#setup","content":"Prefer JSON config? Paste this into your mcp.json:"},"214":{"id":"/docs/ui/agents/cursor-17","page_id":"/docs/ui/agents/cursor","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/agents/cursor#setup","content":"Save and confirm the server shows a green connected status."},"215":{"id":"/docs/ui/agents/cursor-18","page_id":"/docs/ui/agents/cursor","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/agents/cursor#setup","content":"After adding the server, Cursor will prompt you to authorize the connection. A browser window will open — log in with your Ambriel credentials and approve the access request."},"216":{"id":"/docs/ui/agents/cursor-19","page_id":"/docs/ui/agents/cursor","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/agents/cursor#setup","content":"Return to Cursor and verify the Ambriel tools appear in the MCP t