-17","page_id":"/docs/ui/aml/search-configuration","type":"heading","url":"/docs/ui/aml/search-configuration#remarks","content":"Remarks"},"529":{"id":"/docs/ui/aml/search-configuration-18","page_id":"/docs/ui/aml/search-configuration","type":"heading","url":"/docs/ui/aml/search-configuration#how-to-configure-search-settings","content":"How to Configure Search Settings?"},"530":{"id":"/docs/ui/aml/search-configuration-19","page_id":"/docs/ui/aml/search-configuration","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/aml/search-configuration","content":"Search Configuration controls which lists Ambriel searches and how strictly names must match. Lower score thresholds and typo tolerance catch more variants but raise false positives, while higher thresholds stay precise. Start with defaults, enable only the lists your policy requires, then tighten thresholds until alerts stay actionable."},"531":{"id":"/docs/ui/aml/search-configuration-20","page_id":"/docs/ui/aml/search-configuration","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/aml/search-configuration#what-is-search-configuration","content":"Search Configuration is a feature in Ambriel's AML solution that allows you to customize how sanctions lists are searched. You can configure the search settings to better suit your business needs."},"532":{"id":"/docs/ui/aml/search-configuration-21","page_id":"/docs/ui/aml/search-configuration","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/aml/search-configuration#what-are-the-configurations","content":"The following are the configurations you can make:"},"533":{"id":"/docs/ui/aml/search-configuration-22","page_id":"/docs/ui/aml/search-configuration","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/aml/search-configuration#frequency","content":"The frequency determines how often the sanctions list is updated. The options are:"},"534":{"id":"/docs/ui/aml/search-configuration-23","page_id":"/docs/ui/aml/search-configuration","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/aml/search-configuration#frequency","content":"Daily"},"535":{"id":"/docs/ui/aml/search-configuration-24","page_id":"/docs/ui/aml/search-configuration","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/aml/search-configuration#frequency","content":"Weekly"},"536":{"id":"/docs/ui/aml/search-configuration-25","page_id":"/docs/ui/aml/search-configuration","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/aml/search-configuration#frequency","content":"Bi-Weekly"},"537":{"id":"/docs/ui/aml/search-configuration-26","page_id":"/docs/ui/aml/search-configuration","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/aml/search-configuration#frequency","content":"Quarterly"},"538":{"id":"/docs/ui/aml/search-configuration-27","page_id":"/docs/ui/aml/search-configuration","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/aml/search-configuration#frequency","content":"Monthly"},"539":{"id":"/docs/ui/aml/search-configuration-28","page_id":"/docs/ui/aml/search-configuration","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/aml/search-configuration#frequency","content":"Yearly"},"540":{"id":"/docs/ui/aml/search-configuration-29","page_id":"/docs/ui/aml/search-configuration","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/aml/search-configuration#enable-sanctions","content":"Enable sanctions determines whether the sanctions list is enabled or not. If enabled, the sanctions list will be searched when you search for an entity."},"541":{"id":"/docs/ui/aml/search-configuration-30","page_id":"/docs/ui/aml/search-configuration","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/aml/search-configuration#enable-pep","content":"Enable PEP determines whether the PEP list is enabled or not. If enabled, the PEP list will be searched when you search for an entity."},"542":{"id":"/docs/ui/aml/search-configuration-31","page_id":"/docs/ui/aml/search-configuration","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/aml/search-configuration#enable-crime","content":"Enable crime determines whether the crime list is enabled or not. If enabled, the crime list will be searched when you search for an entity."},"543":{"id":"/docs/ui/aml/search-configuration-32","page_id":"/docs/ui/aml/search-configuration","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/aml/search-configuration