 your web application. You can use it to capture user data, track events, and trigger fraud checks."},"767":{"id":"/docs/ui/integration-11","page_id":"/docs/ui/integration","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/integration#e-commerce-plugins","content":"We also provide pre-built plugins for popular e-commerce platforms like Woocommerce, Wix, Shopify, and BigCommerce. These plugins make it easy to integrate Ambriel with your online store, and provide a seamless experience for your customers."},"768":{"id":"/docs/ui/integration-12","page_id":"/docs/ui/integration","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/integration#rest-vs-js-agent-vs-plugin--which-should-you-choose","content":"REST API"},"769":{"id":"/docs/ui/integration-13","page_id":"/docs/ui/integration","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/integration#rest-vs-js-agent-vs-plugin--which-should-you-choose","content":"JavaScript agent"},"770":{"id":"/docs/ui/integration-14","page_id":"/docs/ui/integration","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/integration#rest-vs-js-agent-vs-plugin--which-should-you-choose","content":"E-commerce plugin"},"771":{"id":"/docs/ui/integration-15","page_id":"/docs/ui/integration","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/integration#rest-vs-js-agent-vs-plugin--which-should-you-choose","content":"Best for"},"772":{"id":"/docs/ui/integration-16","page_id":"/docs/ui/integration","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/integration#rest-vs-js-agent-vs-plugin--which-should-you-choose","content":"Custom backends scoring orders, logins, and payouts server-side"},"773":{"id":"/docs/ui/integration-17","page_id":"/docs/ui/integration","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/integration#rest-vs-js-agent-vs-plugin--which-should-you-choose","content":"Web apps needing device fingerprinting and behavioral signals"},"774":{"id":"/docs/ui/integration-18","page_id":"/docs/ui/integration","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/integration#rest-vs-js-agent-vs-plugin--which-should-you-choose","content":"Stores on Shopify, WooCommerce, Wix, or BigCommerce"},"775":{"id":"/docs/ui/inte