ytics","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/products/email-address-analytics#what-does-the-api-return","content":"A POST /v1/email lookup returns domain, deliverability, string-analysis, and breach blocks. The table below covers the fields that separate legitimate users from throwaway accounts."},"1216":{"id":"/docs/ui/products/email-address-analytics-23","page_id":"/docs/ui/products/email-address-analytics","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/products/email-address-analytics#what-does-the-api-return","content":"Field"},"1217":{"id":"/docs/ui/products/email-address-analytics-24","page_id":"/docs/ui/products/email-address-analytics","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/products/email-address-analytics#what-does-the-api-return","content":"What it tells you"},"1218":{"id":"/docs/ui/products/email-address-analytics-25","page_id":"/docs/ui/products/email-address-analytics","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/products/email-address-analytics#what-does-the-api-return","content":"How to use it"},"1219":{"id":"/docs/ui/products/email-address-analytics-26","page_id":"/docs/ui/products/email-address-analytics","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/products/email-address-analytics#what-does-the-api-return","content":"email"},"1220":{"id":"/docs/ui/products/email-address-analytics-27","page_id":"/docs/ui/products/email-address-analytics","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/products/email-address-analytics#what-does-the-api-return","content":"Normalized address that was assessed"},"1221":{"id":"/docs/ui/products/email-address-analytics-28","page_id":"/docs/ui/products/email-address-analytics","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/products/email-address-analytics#what-does-the-api-return","content":"Echo it into your case notes and logs"},"1222":{"id":"/docs/ui/products/email-address-analytics-29","page_id":"/docs/ui/products/email-address-analytics","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/products/email-address-analytics#what-does-the-api-return","content":"domain.disposable / domain.free"},"1223":{"id":"/docs/ui/products/email-address-