efore whitelisting the domain."},"1243":{"id":"/docs/ui/products/ip-address-data","page_id":"/docs/ui/products/ip-address-data","type":"page","content":"IP Address Data","url":"/docs/ui/products/ip-address-data"},"1244":{"id":"/docs/ui/products/ip-address-data-0","page_id":"/docs/ui/products/ip-address-data","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/products/ip-address-data","content":"Leverage IP geolocation and proxy detection for a wide range of applications including marketing optimization, credit scoring, compliance, fraud detection, and security."},"1245":{"id":"/docs/ui/products/ip-address-data-1","page_id":"/docs/ui/products/ip-address-data","type":"heading","url":"/docs/ui/products/ip-address-data#what-is-ip-address-data","content":"What is IP Address Data?"},"1246":{"id":"/docs/ui/products/ip-address-data-2","page_id":"/docs/ui/products/ip-address-data","type":"heading","url":"/docs/ui/products/ip-address-data#key-features","content":"Key Features"},"1247":{"id":"/docs/ui/products/ip-address-data-3","page_id":"/docs/ui/products/ip-address-data","type":"heading","url":"/docs/ui/products/ip-address-data#how-can-you-use-ip-address-data","content":"How can you use IP Address Data?"},"1248":{"id":"/docs/ui/products/ip-address-data-4","page_id":"/docs/ui/products/ip-address-data","type":"heading","url":"/docs/ui/products/ip-address-data#what-does-the-api-return","content":"What does the API return?"},"1249":{"id":"/docs/ui/products/ip-address-data-5","page_id":"/docs/ui/products/ip-address-data","type":"heading","url":"/docs/ui/products/ip-address-data#try-it-example-request","content":"Try it: example request"},"1250":{"id":"/docs/ui/products/ip-address-data-6","page_id":"/docs/ui/products/ip-address-data","type":"heading","url":"/docs/ui/products/ip-address-data#how-to-interpret-ip-address-data-results","content":"How to interpret IP Address Data results?"},"1251":{"id":"/docs/ui/products/ip-address-data-7","page_id":"/docs/ui/products/ip-address-data","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/products/ip-address-data#what-is-ip-address-data","content":"Geolocate and analyze IP addresses to understand the characteristics of a user's digital footprint. Our IP database is updated daily, ensuring the highest accuracy and coverage."},"1252":{"id":"/docs/ui/products/ip-address-data-8","page_id":"/docs/ui/products/ip-address-data","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/products/ip-address-data#what-does-the-api-return","content":"A POST /v1/ip lookup returns three blocks — security, location, and network. The table below covers the fields that drive fraud and compliance decisions."},"1253":{"id":"/docs/ui/products/ip-address-data-9","page_id":"/docs/ui/products/ip-address-data","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/products/ip-address-data#what-does-the-api-return","content":"Field"},"1254":{"id":"/docs/ui/products/ip-address-data-10","page_id":"/docs/ui/products/ip-address-data","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/products/ip-address-data#what-does-the-api-return","content":"What it tells you"},"1255":{"id":"/docs/ui/products/ip-address-data-11","page_id":"/docs/ui/products/ip-address-data","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/products/ip-address-data#what-does-the-api-return","content":"How to use it"},"1256":{"id":"/docs/ui/products/ip-address-data-12","page_id":"/docs/ui/products/ip-address-data","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/products/ip-address-data#what-does-the-api-return","content":"security.vpn / security.proxy"},"1257":{"id":"/docs/ui/products/ip-address-data-13","page_id":"/docs/ui/products/ip-address-data","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/products/ip-address-data#what-does-the-api-return","content":"Whether traffic hides behind a VPN or proxy"},"1258":{"id":"/docs/ui/products/ip-address-data-14","page_id":"/docs/ui/products/ip-address-data","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/products/ip-address-data#what-does-the-api-return","content":"Step up geofenced or high-value actions when true"},"1259":{"id":"/docs/ui/products/ip-address-data-15","page_id":"/docs/ui/products/ip-addres